# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NERV Disaster Prevention — client environment (PUBLIC CONFIG ONLY)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in the two values from
# your Supabase project (Dashboard → Settings → API).
#
# ⚠️  ONLY these two PUBLIC keys belong here. They are safe to ship in the
#     client because Supabase's anon key is gated by Row-Level Security.
#
#     Provider secrets — WEATHERAPI_KEY, MAPTILER_API_KEY, OWM_API_KEY,
#     SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, AGGREGATOR_CRON_SECRET, CONTACT_THROTTLE_SALT,
#     SUPPORT_INBOX — live ONLY in Supabase Secrets
#     (`supabase secrets set ...`) and are read server-side by the Edge
#     Functions. main.dart FAILS a release build if a secret-shaped value
#     appears here.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-PUBLIC-KEY
